atur status chatroom bot
{command} [here/everywhere/catroom's_name] [chat/away/xa/dnd] [status_text]
*/{command} here xa I'm far far away
bot akan mengatur status "xa" dengan teks "I'm far far away" di conference ini
*/{command} everywhere xa I'm far far away
bot akan mengatur status di semua chat tempat dia aktif
*/{command} some_chat@c.j.ru xa I'm far far away
bot akan mengatur status di some_chat@c.j.ru
